+## GitHub Issues
+
+### [Issue 2](https://github.com/mity/md4c/issues/2)
+
+Raw HTML block:
+
+```````````````````````````````` example
+<gi att1=tok1 att2=tok2>
+.
+<gi att1=tok1 att2=tok2>
+````````````````````````````````
+
+Inline:
+
+```````````````````````````````` example
+foo <gi att1=tok1 att2=tok2> bar
+.
+<p>foo <gi att1=tok1 att2=tok2> bar</p>
+````````````````````````````````
+
+Inline with a line break:
+
+```````````````````````````````` example
+foo <gi att1=tok1
+att2=tok2> bar
+.
+<p>foo <gi att1=tok1
+att2=tok2> bar</p>
+````````````````````````````````
+
